{"id":"u47","kelas":12,"no":6,"judul":"Persiapan Akhir","title":"Final Review","emoji":"🏁","ringkas":"Latihan campuran semua materi sampai kelas 12","ready":true,"goals":["mengulang **tense**, modal, passive, conditional, dan reported speech","mengulang **jenis teks** dari Kelas 10 dan 11: descriptive, recount, procedure, narrative, exposition, explanation, news item, letter","mengulang strategi **membaca** dan pola soal **tata bahasa**","mengulang ungkapan **wawancara kerja** dan berpendapat","mengerjakan **latihan campuran** dari seluruh materi sampai Kelas 12"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Selamat, ini **unit terakhir**! Di sini kamu **mengulang semuanya**: tense, jenis teks, tata bahasa ujian, dan percakapan. Baca rangkuman, lalu kerjakan Latihan dan Kuis campuran. Kamu sudah menempuh perjalanan panjang dari Kelas 7 sampai 12. 🎉"},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Rangkuman tense","table":[["Tense","Rumus","Contoh"],["**Simple present**","V1 (he/she/it + s)","[[She plays tennis.]]"],["**Present continuous**","am/is/are + V-ing","[[She is playing now.]]"],["**Simple past**","V2 / was / were","[[She played yesterday.]]"],["**Past continuous**","was/were + V-ing","[[She was playing when I came.]]"],["**Present perfect**","have/has + V3","[[She has played for years.]]"],["**Past perfect**","had + V3","[[She had played before I arrived.]]"],["**Future**","will + V1 / be going to + V1","[[She will play tomorrow.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Rangkuman pola kalimat","table":[["Topik","Ingat"],["**Modal**","can, must, should, may, will + kata kerja dasar"],["**Passive**","to be + V3: [[The room is cleaned.]] / [[was built]] / [[has been finished]] / [[will be opened]]"],["**Conditional 1**","if + present, will + V1"],["**Conditional 2**","if + past (were), would + V1"],["**Conditional 3**","if + had V3, would have V3"],["**Reported speech**","tense bergeser ke belakang: [[am → was]], [[will → would]]"],["**Comparison**","taller than, the tallest; more beautiful, the most beautiful"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Rangkuman jenis teks","table":[["Jenis teks","Tujuan","Struktur"],["**Descriptive**","mendeskripsikan","Identification, Description"],["**Recount**","menceritakan pengalaman","Orientation, Events, Re-orientation"],["**Procedure**","menjelaskan cara","Goal, Materials, Steps"],["**Narrative**","menghibur","Orientation, Complication, Resolution"],["**Analytical exposition**","meyakinkan bahwa sesuatu demikian","Thesis, Arguments, Reiteration"],["**Hortatory exposition**","mengajak bertindak","Thesis, Arguments, Recommendation"],["**Explanation**","menjelaskan proses","General Statement, Sequenced Explanation"],["**News item**","memberitakan peristiwa","Headline, Newsworthy Event, Background, Sources"],["**Application letter**","melamar pekerjaan","salutation, opening, body, closing"],["**Announcement / invitation**","memberi informasi / mengundang","what, when, where, who, contact"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Ungkapan penting","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Berpendapat","[[In my opinion, ...]] / [[I'm afraid I disagree.]]"],["Kontras","[[but]], [[however]], [[although]], [[on the other hand]]"],["Saran","[[should]], [[ought to]], [[had better]], [[Let's ...]]"],["Wawancara","[[Tell me about yourself.]] / [[I am a quick learner.]]"],["Surat formal","[[I am writing to apply for ...]] / [[I look forward to hearing from you.]]"],["Urutan","[[first]], [[then]], [[next]], [[finally]]"],["Sebab-akibat","[[because]], [[so]], [[therefore]], [[as a result]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Strategi ujian","text":"1. **Baca soal dulu**, lalu skim teks dan scan kata kunci.\n2. **Coret** pilihan yang jelas salah.\n3. Untuk tata bahasa, cek **subjek, petunjuk waktu, bentuk kata kerja**.\n4. Waspadai kata ekstrem: *always, never, all, only*.\n5. Atur waktu: lewati soal sulit, **periksa ulang** di akhir."},{"t":"tip","title":"Terus berlatih","text":"Dengarkan lagu, tonton video, dan baca teks berbahasa Inggris setiap hari. Tulis lima kata baru per hari dan pakai dalam kalimat. Klik kata berwarna di unit sebelumnya untuk melatih pelafalan."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Menjelang ujian","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Class, the exam is next week. How do you feel?","id":"Anak-anak, ujian minggu depan. Bagaimana perasaan kalian?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"A little nervous, but I have practised a lot.","id":"Sedikit gugup, tetapi aku sudah banyak berlatih."},{"who":"Tom","en":"If we read the questions carefully, we will do well.","id":"Jika kita membaca soal dengan teliti, kita akan berhasil."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Exactly. Good luck, everyone!","id":"Betul. Semoga berhasil, semuanya!"}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Tense: pilih berdasarkan **petunjuk waktu**.","Passive, conditional, dan reported speech: perhatikan **bentuk kata kerja**.","Teks: kenali **tujuan** dan **struktur** tiap jenis teks.","Ujian: baca soal dulu, eliminasi, cek ulang.","Terima kasih sudah belajar sampai akhir. Teruslah berlatih! 🎉"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis teks dengan tujuannya:","pairs":[["descriptive","mendeskripsikan"],["recount","menceritakan pengalaman"],["procedure","menjelaskan cara"],["news item","memberitakan peristiwa"]],"exp":"Tujuan teks.","k":"03a3b063"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis teks dengan strukturnya:","pairs":[["narrative","Orientation, Complication, Resolution"],["hortatory","Thesis, Arguments, Recommendation"],["explanation","General Statement, Sequenced Explanation"],["procedure","Goal, Materials, Steps"]],"exp":"Struktur teks.","k":"ec76f963"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan tipe conditional dengan rumusnya:","pairs":[["Type 1","if + present, will + V1"],["Type 2","if + past, would + V1"],["Type 3","if + had V3, would have V3"]],"exp":"Conditional.","k":"f93f3051"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar? \"She ___ to school every day.\"","options":["goes","go","going","gone"],"answer":0,"exp":"simple present.","k":"aaf93b6f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar? \"They ___ football now.\"","options":["are playing","play","played","have played"],"answer":0,"exp":"now → present continuous.","k":"5a4abcaf"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar? \"We ___ to Bali last year.\"","options":["went","go","have gone","will go"],"answer":0,"exp":"last year → simple past.","k":"be2c9a5d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar? \"I ___ here since 2020.\"","options":["have lived","live","lived","am living"],"answer":0,"exp":"since → present perfect.","k":"8f8d8f0f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar? \"I ___ when the phone rang.\"","options":["was sleeping","slept","sleep","have slept"],"answer":0,"exp":"past continuous.","k":"924ca125"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar? \"If it rains, we ___ at home.\"","options":["will stay","would stay","stayed","had stayed"],"answer":0,"exp":"Type 1.","k":"8aa736ef"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar? \"If I were rich, I ___ travel.\"","options":["would","will","had","can be"],"answer":0,"exp":"Type 2.","k":"4f2cb7e7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar? \"If she had studied, she ___ have passed.\"","options":["would","will","can","must"],"answer":0,"exp":"Type 3.","k":"40c2a67b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pasif yang benar adalah...","options":["The bridge was built in 1990.","The bridge built in 1990.","The bridge is build in 1990.","The bridge were built in 1990."],"answer":0,"exp":"was + V3.","k":"bf04a0dd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Reported speech dari \"I am tired,\" she said adalah...","options":["She said that she was tired.","She said that she is tired.","She said that I was tired.","She said that she has tired."],"answer":0,"exp":"am → was.","k":"2e487a50"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Reported question dari \"Where do you live?\" he asked adalah...","options":["He asked where I lived.","He asked where did I live.","He asked where I live?","He asked where do I live."],"answer":0,"exp":"Urutan biasa.","k":"1409ea85"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang diakhiri \"Therefore, let's save water.\" adalah...","options":["hortatory exposition","ana